# Optional: enable the Claude AI fallback for free-text questions the
# rule-based matcher can't confidently handle.
#
# The chatbot works fully WITHOUT this key (rule-based menu + keyword matching).
# When set, free-text questions with no confident match are answered by Claude.
#
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: port for the Flask web app (defaults to 5000)
# PORT=5000
